usage:
For leaderboards, priority queues and anything whose order is the message. The FLIP technique makes rows glide to their new positions instead of jumping. This part re-ranks sample scores; it is not a drag-to-sort list. Add data-rank-autoplay="off" to the list to start paused. Listen for new orders:

```js
document.addEventListener('kata-reorder-change', event => {
  console.log(event.detail.order, event.detail.source);
});
```
